* **PHY-STR**: Structural & Mechanical Kinematics — Pedestal slewing ring, luffing/telescopic boom structure, and 2x high-complexity Siebenhaar gearboxes with internal oil-released multi-disc brakes (50 bar release).
* **PHY-ELP**: Electro-Programmable & Transduction Hardware — Legacy S7-300 CPU 315-2DP, target Altus Nexto PLC, solenoids, pressure transducers, encoders, and safety relays.
