### Axis 2: Epistemological & Cybernetic Flow (CYB)
* **CYB-ING (Layer 0)**: Epistemic Artifact Ingestion — Read-only parsing of S7 PDFs/texts into dependency DAGs and global symbol tables.
* **CYB-TRN (Layer 0)**: Isomorphic Semantic Transpilation — Converting S7 STL/LAD/FBD, S5TIME, Big-Endian words, and AR1/AR2 pointers into strongly-typed Altus ST and LD.
* **CYB-VER (Layer 0)**: Formal Equivalence & Deontic Verification — Auditing canonical Boolean parity (Output_S7 === Output_Altus) and NR-12 safety invariants.
* **CYB-OBS (Layer 1)**: State Observation — Real-time sensor acquisition, pressure correlation, and manual valve permutation state inference.
* **CYB-NET (Layer 1)**: Fieldbus & Slip-Ring Transport — Deterministic Profibus-DP communication and diagnostic status polling across the rotating pedestal interface.
* **CYB-NOM (Layer 1)**: Nomological Regulation (Target: Altus ST) — Continuous closed-loop control, A4V/A6VM swashplate modulation, ramps, and 2-DOF LML math.
* **CYB-DEO (Layer 1)**: Deontic Interlock Governance (Target: Altus LD) — Hard safety obligations/prohibitions, Siebenhaar 50 bar brake sequencing, anti-collision, and E-Stop/LOTO cutoffs.

### Axis 3: Axiological / Normative Teleology (GOV)
* **GOV-BIO**: Human Life & Operator Safety — Compliance with NR-12, LOTO, and maritime crew protection.
* **GOV-AST**: Asset & Structural Integrity — Prevention of crane overturning, cylinder buckling, cavitation, or Siebenhaar gearbox brake dragging.
* **GOV-SYS**: Epistemic & Computational Determinism — Zero semantic drift, scan-cycle integrity, endianness alignment, and fault-tolerant network diagnostics.

