## 3. DEONTIC & ISOMORPHIC GOVERNANCE RULES
1. **OBL_FAIL_SAFE**: Preserve Normally Closed (0 = Trip, 1 = Healthy) fail-safe polarity without intermediate logic inversion.
2. **PROH_MULTI_COIL**: Consolidate scattered S7 Set/Reset (S/R) coils into single-network LD assignments.
3. **OBL_NR12_RESET**: Require rising-edge manual reset (R_TRIG) with External Device Monitoring (EDM) feedback before re-enabling actuators or 50 bar brake release rails.
4. **OBL_BRAKE_SYNC (CRN-L1.5)**: Prohibit Siebenhaar 50 bar brake release unless 350 bar A4V/A6VM closed-loop holding torque is verified; trip 350 bar drive immediately if 50 bar pilot rail drops below threshold.
5. **OBL_VALVE_PERM (CRN-L1.2)**: Lock out A4V pump swashplate excitation unless manual valve permutation state is confirmed via limit switches or HMI + delta-P pre-check.
6. **OBL_ENDIAN_SAFE (META-L0.2)**: Invert S7 Big-Endian byte offsets (MB0/MB1 in MW0) when unpacking Profibus PIW/PQW words into Altus little-endian structures.
